- [ ] B ≥ 1000 for reliable inference
- [ ] Parallel implementation for speed
- [ ] Multiple CI methods available
- [ ] Coverage validated via simulation
- [ ] Seed handling for reproducibility
- [ ] Memory-efficient for large data
